      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "satirical_meme_format",
      "label": "Satirical Meme Format",
      "description": "A meme format that uses irony, exaggeration, or absurdity to critique or mock a situation, often by juxtaposing contradictory statements or images. The meme’s use of a woman’s passionate expression with contradictory text is a classic satirical format used to highlight perceived hypocrisy or absurdity in political or social issues. Understanding this format is necessary to interpret the meme’s intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
