      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The woman is mapped as the speaker of the protest text",
      "description": "The visual entity 'woman' is mapped onto the textual entity 'text_chunk_1' because she is holding the protest sign and her passionate expression is juxtaposed with the text, implying she is the one demanding the sanctuary city policy. The text 'we demand our city be made a sanctuary city for illegals!' is presented as if spoken or advocated by the woman in the image, creating an analogical mapping where the woman represents the speaker or embodiment of the text's message.",
