      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "anti-immigrant sentiment supporters",
      "description": "The meme is designed to resonate with individuals who hold anti-immigrant views, particularly those who oppose sanctuary city policies. The use of the term 'illegals' and the satirical framing of sanctuary cities as hypocritical or contradictory are intended to provoke agreement or outrage among those who believe immigration enforcement should be prioritized over local policy autonomy. The meme leverages the stereotype of elderly activists as morally driven to amplify its message, potentially appealing to audiences who view such figures as symbols of civic virtue in the context of immigration debates.",
